            "review_title": "Review at Bigbro Korean Hotdog",
            "review_text": "Vacation40512046458\n1 contribution\n0\nBad experience because of security\nSep 2023 • Friends\nI was really upset with the security guard at the shop. My friend and I went to ask if there was a parking space, he asked one of us to wait, and the other to go in and buy. I asked my friend to come buy it and I waited. My friend came in and the uncle kept telling me to drive here and there, then he said it was 30 minutes and asked him if he was waiting to buy it. I repeated several times that my friend had come in to buy, but the uncle's attitude was as if he didn't want customers to come and buy, so he told me to drive somewhere and wait instead of standing here blocking the way for people to get in and out. He was the one who told me to run and leave as he wanted and then told me to run wherever I wanted. A very bad experience\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten September 21, 2023",
