            "review_title": "Review at Bigbro Korean Hotdog",
            "review_text": "Ian S\nRushden, United Kingdom335 contributions\n0\nYum\nOct 2018 • Solo\nI'd walked past, it's only a narrow place, but promised myself I would have one soon.\nI'm not the only tourist, I'm having the chedda(sic), sit down and wait. It's a narrow bench along the wall, the deep fryer is quite small and it's a bit of a wait.\nAsked if I want to eat in or out, it's out, a couple of tubs produced for sauce, I opt for Mayo and ketchup in one, hot Korean sauce in the other.\nI walk off and sit on the squares nearby and it's great, hot sausage, cheese and sauces. For the price it's a fantastic snack, only 43,000 dong, I'm tempted to go back but I need room for my evening meal and a few beers.\nRead more\nWritten November 21, 2018",
